# What `gh release list --json tagName,isDraft,isPrerelease` prints on stdout: the raw JSON the weekly
# base rebuild's selection reads (scripts/latest-final-release.sh; FR8 of add-sandbox-base-image,
# design D15). gh lists releases newest-created first. The arrays are indented as gh prints them on a
# terminal rather than on one line as it prints them into a pipe: the script reads either form
# through jq, and a one-line array of objects would read as a section header of this file. Some
# answers hold drafts and pre-releases that `--exclude-drafts --exclude-pre-releases` keeps out of a
# real listing: the script leaves them out by itself, whatever the server returned.
# One section per answer: its lines up to the blank line that separates it from the next one.

